title: FirstSpiritIntro
---


<<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator character_scared>>
<<play_emote_plain player_emote exclaim>>
Dawn: It that a… <shake>ghost?!</shake>

Dawn: Nup, nope, I’m out of here. Sorry Grams. <sketchy><b>This is just too much.<sketchy></b>.

Spirit: Wait, wait!

Spirit: Wow, it’s been a long time since I’ve seen a human here.

Spirit: Are you… wait, I know you. Or at least I think I do…

Spirit: Anne, is that you? You’ve gotten younger. And leaner.

Dawn: That’s my Grandma you’re talking about. My name is Dawn.

Spirit: Grandma? I didn’t think it had been that long.

Spirit: It’s nice to meet you Dawn.
    -> Hi!
        <<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator character_wave>>
        Dawn: Hi!
        Spirit: Woob worb. Hi!
    -> It's nice to meet you too!
        <<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator character_wave>>
        Dawn: Well it's a pleasure to meet you too... spirit guy?
        Spirit: Blooop.
Spirit: She. This place. It’s been left alone so long, that all my friends have left.

Spirit: Now it’s just me. I don’t get why she would just leave us. This place broke down, and the spiritual energy with it.

Spirit: But now you’re here, maybe you can help!

//Go Through backstory and then come back
